# Public production domain, used for canonical URLs, Open Graph, sitemap.xml and robots.txt.
# Safe to expose (NEXT_PUBLIC_*) — it is not a secret. Set this in Vercel's project
# environment variables too, so canonicals resolve correctly in production.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://tarunmakhija.in

# --- Enquiry form delivery (server-only — never prefix these with NEXT_PUBLIC_) ---
# Configure ONE channel. Until one is set, the contact form tells visitors their enquiry was
# NOT sent and offers a prefilled email instead — it never fakes a success message.
#
# Option A: POST the enquiry as JSON to a webhook (Zapier, Make, n8n, a Slack workflow, a CRM, …).
# CONTACT_WEBHOOK_URL=
#
# Option B: send an email through Resend (https://resend.com). The FROM address must be on a verified domain.
# RESEND_API_KEY=
# CONTACT_TO_EMAIL=teamtarunspeaks@gmail.com
# CONTACT_FROM_EMAIL=TarunSpeaks Website <enquiries@your-verified-domain>
